      "description": "The integrations sub-graph — a NAMED SUB-GRAPH of the harness, OPT-IN like `sdlc`: off in every layer unless that layer lists `cat-harness.integrations` in its own `enableSubgraphs` (owner, 2026-11-10, card Q-SG-1 C, wave 1). It holds the Tool definitions that bind the harness to an outside service: the git hosts' change-proposal tools (`github-pr-*`, `github-branches`, `gitlab-mr-*`, `gitlab-branches`, whose operations `skills-and-tools` names), the MCP capture and server-image tools, and `upload-step-docs`. The graph inside it, `integrations-tools`, is declared FROM WITHIN, in `integrations/graph.json`. Their implementations stay in the tools layer (https://github.com/litlfred/cat-harness-tools).",
